  "source": "## Semantics: S1, S5, T1, C3, M0, A1\ngrammar ConformanceTrailingTrivia version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## Whitespace trivia.\n  trivia = 1*\" \"\n  ## A key followed by \"=\"; trailing whitespace must be consumed by the\n  ## entry-boundary skip before the full-consumption check.\n  main = 1*%x61-7A \"=\"\n\n  skip = trivia\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"a=\"\n    accept \"a=   \"\n    accept \"  a =  \"\n    reject \"a= !\"\n  }\n}\n",
